(2, 'privacy_policy', E'<h3><strong>1. Information We Collect</strong></h3><p>We collect the following types of information:</p><h4><strong>a. Personal Information</strong></h4><ul><li>Name, email address, phone number, and delivery address.</li><li>Payment information (e.g., mobile money details or credit card information).</li></ul><h4><strong>b. Non-Personal Information</strong></h4><ul><li>Device details (e.g., model, operating system, and app version).</li><li>Usage data (e.g., pages viewed, time spent on the app).</li></ul><h4><strong>c. Health Information</strong></h4><ul><li>Information you provide about reproductive health preferences or needs, solely for the purpose of fulfilling orders and offering relevant products.</li></ul><h4><strong>d. Location Data</strong></h4><ul><li>With your consent, we collect location data to provide delivery services and improve our offerings.</li></ul><hr><h3><strong>2. How We Use Your Information</strong></h3><p>We use your information to:</p><ul><li>Process and deliver your orders.</li><li>Communicate with you about your account or orders.</li><li>Offer personalized product recommendations.</li><li>Improve the app’s functionality and user experience.</li><li>Comply with legal obligations.</li></ul><hr><h3><strong>3. Sharing Your Information</strong></h3><p>We do not sell or rent your personal information. However, we may share your information with:</p><ul><li><strong>Delivery Partners:</strong> To facilitate order delivery.</li><li><strong>Payment Processors:</strong> To process payments securely.</li><li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> For app maintenance, hosting, and analytics.</li><li><strong>Legal Authorities:</strong> If required by law or to protect our rights.</li></ul><hr><h3><strong>4. Data Security</strong></h3><p>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your information, including encryption and secure servers. However, no system is entirely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p><hr><h3><strong>5. Your Privacy Choices</strong></h3><h4><strong>a. Access and Update Information</strong></h4><p>You can access and update your account details in the App settings.</p><h4><strong>b. Opt-Out of Marketing</strong></h4><p>You may opt out of promotional emails or notifications via the app settings or by contacting us.</p><h4><strong>c. Location Data</strong></h4><p>You can disable location tracking in your device settings.</p><hr><h3><strong>6. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</strong></h3><p>We use cookies and similar technologies to:</p><ul><li>Enhance your user experience.</li><li>Analyze app performance.<br>You can manage cookie preferences in your device or browser settings.</li></ul><hr><h3><strong>7. Retention of Information</strong></h3><p>We retain your personal information as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy or comply with legal requirements.</p><hr><h3><strong>8. Third-Party Links</strong></h3><p>The app may contain links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for their privacy practices. Please review their privacy policies before providing your information.</p><hr><h3><strong>9. Children\\''s Privacy</strong></h3><p>The app is not intended for individuals under 18 years old. We do not knowingly collect information from minors.</p><hr><h3><strong>10. Changes to This Policy</strong></h3><p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. We will notify you of significant changes through the app or via email. Your continued use of the app signifies your acceptance of the updated policy.</p><hr><h3><strong>11. Contact Us</strong></h3><p>If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, contact us at:</p><ul><li><strong>Email:</strong> support@reprohealth.com</li><li><strong>Phone:</strong> +2119123456789</li><li><strong>Address:</strong> Juba South Sudan</li></ul><hr><p>By using the app, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy.</p>'),
(3, 'terms_conditions', E'<h3><span xss=removed>1. Acceptance of Terms</span></h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><p><span xss=removed>By accessing or using the App, you confirm that you are at least 18 years old and capable of entering into a legally binding agreement.</span></p><hr></div></div></div></div></h3><h3>2. Account Registration</h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><ul><li>You must create an account to use the App.</li><li>You agree to provide accurate and complete information during registration and update it as necessary.</li><li>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials.</li></ul><hr></div></div></div></div></h3><h3>3. Use of the App</h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><p>You agree to:</p><ul><li>Use the App only for lawful purposes.</li><li>Not use the App to violate any applicable laws or regulations.</li><li>Not engage in any activity that disrupts or interferes with the App\\''s functionality or security.</li></ul><hr></div></div></div></div></h3><h3>4. Orders and Payments</h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><ul><li>By placing an order, you agree to pay the full price, including applicable taxes and delivery fees.</li><li>Payment methods include mobile money, credit/debit cards, or cash on delivery (where available).</li><li>Orders are subject to availability, and we reserve the right to cancel or refuse any order at our discretion.</li></ul><hr></div></div></div></div></h3><h3>5. Delivery Policy</h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><ul><li>We strive to deliver orders promptly but cannot guarantee specific delivery times due to unforeseen circumstances.</li><li>You are responsible for providing accurate delivery information. Incorrect information may result in delays or additional charges.</li></ul><hr></div></div></div></div></h3><h3>6. Returns and Refunds</h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><ul><li>Returns or refunds are only accepted for defective or damaged items.</li><li>Requests must be made within 7 days of receiving the item.</li><li>Refunds will be processed using the original payment method.</li></ul><hr></div></div></div></div></h3><h3>7. Product Disclaimer</h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><p>The products offered on the App are for personal use only. We do not provide medical advice. Consult a healthcare professional before using any reproductive health product.</p><hr></div></div></div></div></h3><h3>8. Privacy Policy</h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><p>Your use of the App is also governed by our Privacy Policy, which explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.</p><hr></div></div></div></div></h3><h3>9. Intellectual Property</h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><ul><li>All content on the App, including logos, text, images, and software, is the property of Reprohealth or its licensors.</li><li>You may not copy, distribute, or modify any content without prior written consent.</li></ul><hr></div></div></div></div></h3><h3>10. Termination</h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><p>We may suspend or terminate your access to the App at any time if you violate these Terms or engage in unlawful activities.</p><hr></div></div></div></div></h3><h3>11. Limitation of Liability</h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><ul><li>Reprohealth is not liable for damages arising from the use or inability to use the App, including delays or product unavailability.</li><li>We are not responsible for the actions of third-party delivery partners or payment processors.</li></ul><hr></div></div></div></div></h3><h3>12. Governing Law</h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><p>These Terms are governed by the laws of South Sudan. Any disputes will be resolved in the courts of Juba.</p><hr></div></div></div></div></h3><h3>13. Changes to Terms</h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><p>We reserve the right to update these Terms at any time. Significant changes will be communicated through the App or via email. Continued use of the App after updates signifies your acceptance of the revised Terms.</p><hr></div></div></div></div></h3><h3>14. Contact Us</h3><h3><div class=\\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\"assistant\\" data-message-id=\\"f42cbfe1-989b-450e-958a-74179630f1c5\\" dir=\\"auto\\" class=\\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5\\" data-message-model-slug=\\"gpt-4o\\"><div class=\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\\"><div class=\\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\\"><p>If you have questions about these Terms, contact us at:</p><ul><li xss=removed><span xss=removed>Email:</span> support@reprohealth.com</li><li xss=removed><span xss=removed>Phone:</span> +2119123456789</li><li xss=removed><span xss=removed>Address:</span> Juba South Sudan</li></ul><hr><p>By using the App, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to these Terms and Conditions.</p></div></div></div></div></h3>'),
