(8, 'about_us', '<h4><strong>1. What is this app about?</strong></h4><h2><p>Our app provides fast and discreet delivery of reproductive health products such as contraceptives, pregnancy tests, fertility aids, and more. We prioritize your privacy and convenience.</p></h2><h4><strong>2. How do I place an order?</strong></h4><h2><ul><li>Download the app from your app store.</li><li>Register and log in.</li><li>Browse our catalog, add items to your cart, and proceed to checkout.</li><li>Enter your delivery details, select a payment method, and confirm your order.</li></ul></h2><h4><strong>3. Is my information confidential?</strong></h4><h2><p>Absolutely. We take your privacy seriously. All your personal and order information is encrypted and securely stored.</p></h2><h4><strong>4. How long does delivery take?</strong></h4><h2><p>Delivery times depend on your location, but we strive to deliver orders within <strong>[insert timeframe, e.g., 1-3 hours for local deliveries]</strong>.</p></h2><h4><strong>5. What payment methods do you accept?</strong></h4><h2><p>We accept payments via:</p><ul><li>Mobile money services (e.g., M-Pesa, Airtel Money)</li><li>Credit/debit cards</li><li>Cash on delivery (selected locations)</li></ul></h2><h4><strong>6. Can I schedule a delivery?</strong></h4><h2><p>Yes, you can schedule a delivery at your convenience during the checkout process.</p></h2><h4><strong>7. What products are available?</strong></h4><h2><p>We offer a wide range of products, including:</p><ul><li>Contraceptives (pills, condoms, IUDs)</li><li>Pregnancy and ovulation test kits</li><li>Fertility supplements</li><li>Intimate hygiene products</li><li>Lubricants and other reproductive health essentials</li></ul></h2><h4><strong>8. Are there any age restrictions for ordering?</strong></h4><h2><p>Yes. Customers must be at least <strong>18 years old</strong> to purchase certain products, in compliance with local laws.</p></h2><h4><strong>9. Can I track my order?</strong></h4><h2><p>Yes. You will receive real-time updates and can track your order in the app.</p></h2><h4><strong>10. What happens if a product is unavailable?</strong></h4><h2><p>If an item is unavailable, we will notify you immediately and provide alternatives or the option to cancel that product from your order.</p></h2><h4><strong>11. Can I return or exchange products?</strong></h4><h2><p>Due to the nature of reproductive health products, returns or exchanges are only accepted for defective or damaged items. Contact our support team for assistance.</p></h2><h4><strong>12. Do you offer consultations?</strong></h4><h2><p>Yes, we provide virtual consultations with licensed healthcare professionals for product advice and guidance.</p></h2>'),
